61. PILOT ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

Create:

PILOT-ACCEPTANCE.md

The pilot is successful when:

1. Administrator can create an exam.
2. Administrator can import roster.
3. Administrator can configure rooms.
4. Administrator can assign seats.
5. Administrator can import Crowdmark template.
6. Administrator can generate personalized exams.
7. QR codes are present and scannable.
8. Signature lists are correct.
9. Seating maps are correct.
10. Administration package is complete.
11. Unauthorized users cannot access confidential documents.
12. Audit events are recorded.
13. Backup/restore procedure is verified.
14. No critical security issues remain.

